box-loadout-metadata-editor-empty-hint = <default>

box-loadout-metadata-editor-custom-name = Custom name
box-loadout-metadata-editor-custom-name-tooltip = The name of this item. Leave empty to use the default. NOTE: Does not work if the loadout option provides multiple items.

box-loadout-metadata-editor-custom-desc = Custom description
box-loadout-metadata-editor-custom-desc-tooltip = The description of this item. Leave empty to use the default. NOTE: Does not work if the loadout option provides multiple items.

box-loadout-metadata-editor-apply-to-all = Copy text to all
box-loadout-metadata-editor-apply-to-all-tooltip =
    If checked, this loadout's custom name and description will be copied to
    all other selected job loadouts that can select the same item.
    This will NOT automatically select this loadout for other jobs - only edit existing selections.

box-loadout-metadata-editor-copy-loadout-to-all = Copy item to all
box-loadout-metadata-editor-copy-loadout-to-all-tooltip =
    If checked, this item will be copied to all other job loadouts that support it.
    Only job loadouts that have been modified in some capacity will be affected;
    If you have never changed the loadout for a job, the item will not be copied to that job.
    THIS MAY OVERWRITE OTHER LOADOUTS. Use this function with caution and make profile backups if you're unsure!
